  title="Admissions for Addiction Treatment | H.O.P.E.S.S."
  description="How admissions works at H.O.P.E.S.S.: call, verify coverage, and coordinate residential or outpatient treatment."
  eyebrow="Admissions"
  heading="How admissions works."
